CLAUDE.md
HIDDEN_PROJECTS.md
# --- Source documents with PII: never commit these -------------------------
# Official records (transcripts, report cards) carry a student ID, date of
# birth, parent names, and ethnicity/gender fields. This repo is PUBLIC and is
# the live site, so none of that can land here — not even in a branch, since
# git history is permanent. Keep the real files outside the repo folder; these
# patterns are the backstop against an accidental `git add -A`.
*transcript*
*Transcript*
*report-card*
*report_card*
*ReportCard*

# Loose scans and photos dropped at the repo ROOT. Leading slash = root only,
# so genuine site assets under assets/img/ and assets/documents/ stay tracked.
/*.pdf
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png
/*.heic
/*.webp

# --- Markdown: local-only working notes -------------------------------------
# Planning docs, briefs and TODO lists are internal notes, and this repo is
# public and IS the live site. Ignore markdown by default, with two exceptions.
*.md

# CLAUDE.md is the contributor guide and belongs in the repo.
!CLAUDE.md

# LOAD-BEARING — DO NOT REMOVE. The AI Lab's network-defense demo fetches these
# five phase prompts at RUNTIME from the live site
# (https://pymite6941.is-a.dev/agents/Network%20Defense%20Agents/Phase%20N.md).
# Untracking them stops GitHub Pages serving them and the Red Team Agent demo
# breaks. They are deployed content, not notes.
!agents/Network Defense Agents/*.md
